<title>USA: First Commonwealth acquires dental plan. [CORRECTED 20:29 GMT]</title>
<headline>First Commonwealth acquires dental plan. [CORRECTED 20:29 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Commonwealth Inc said Thursday it has completed its acquisition of Champion Dental Services Inc, a St. Louis, Missouri based prepaid dental plan.</p>
<p>The company said in October it would pay $5.5 million (corrects from $5.3 million) to acquire the plan from Group Health Plan Inc, a wholly owned subsidiary of Coventry Corp.</p>
<p>Shares of dental benefits company First Commonwealth were down 3/8 at 19-3/8 Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
